# UI Framework

Full plan: [docs/UI_FRAMEWORK.md](docs/UI_FRAMEWORK.md). Packages live under `packages/`.

## Do

- New shared UI → implement in `@datawise/ui` / `@datawise/overlays` / `@datawise/chrome` (or extend existing package)
- New icons → prefer `DwPhIcon` (Phosphor); keep `DwIcon` (Lucide) for existing shell keys
- Theme / tokens → `@datawise/tokens` CSS + `@datawise/theme` `applyTheme` / inject symbols
- Host re-export from `@/core/components` for gradual adoption
- Run `npm run audit:packages-boundary` before merging package changes

## Don't

- Import `@/features`, `@/shared/api`, `@/shared/connection` from `packages/*`
- `defineStore` or bare `useI18n()` inside packages (use `useDwI18n` / inject)
- Put DbType / connector business / pack paywall into framework packages
- Global-register Phosphor (`app.use`) — tree-shake breaks
